  "properties": {
    "title": "fAIr - Community AI Assisted Mapping Roadmap",
    "description": "fAIr is an open AI-assisted mapping service developed by the Humanitarian OpenStreetMap Team (HOT) that aims to improve the efficiency and accuracy of mapping efforts for humanitarian purposes. The service uses AI models, specifically computer vision techniques, to detect objects in satellite and UAV imagery.",
